      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a proposal for the city council regarding the West End district. We're trying to pitch a major revitalization project to get more investment into the area. Can you help me write a summary of the \"current neighborhood character\" that explains to stakeholders why the area currently lacks the prestige or stability needed for high-end development and why it really needs this upgrade? I want to be professional but clear about why the current state of the district is holding the city back.",
